#==============================================================================================
#
#   custom_property_data - CSS::CustomPropertyData: chains of custom property maps, and
#                          CustomPropertyRegistration's equality
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/CustomPropertyData.cpp (lines 1-124), CustomPropertyData.h's inline
#       members and CustomPropertyRegistration.h's operator==. A CustomPropertyData is
#       ref-counted in C++: here it is a managed blob made with `new` (DESIGN.md §3.3). The
#       members C++ declares `mutable` (the inheritable() cache) are written through a cast of
#       the const receiver.
